// Orchicon ApprovalService.
//
// The ApprovalService manages the human-in-the-loop approval gate for
// workflow steps. An APPROVAL step in a workflow blocks at
// approval_pending until a human reviews the upstream context (diff,
// summary, AC) and approves or rejects it. The decision is written to
// .orchicon/ files so downstream workers and loop-back steps can read
// the outcome.
//
// Future: notifications (SMS, email, browser), RBAC enforcement
// (which users/groups can approve at project/work-item scope).

